  "bodyHash": "l627IT0k+7U=",
  "content": "<h1>暮色森林 - <del>地牢</del>与村庄</h1><p>！！这是模组<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilight-forest-dungeons-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地牢与村庄</a>的副本，但移除了地牢仅保留村庄，您不能同时安装这两个模组。如果您需要地牢和村庄，请安装<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/twilight-forest-dungeons-villages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">地牢与村庄</a>模组！！</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/8c50f1461c986b912e57904acff886b104a1336a_0.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>模组介绍</h2><p>为暮色森林模组添加新内容。</p><ul>\n<li>村庄现会生成于暮色森林中</li>\n<li>5种新职业，附带全新交易物品与方块</li>\n<li>新的矿工商贩生物会偶尔在您附近生成</li>\n<li><del>地牢会在地下生成</del></li>\n</ul><h3>新增装饰方块</h3><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ae3614fea51618bf60d42c2168d8b193cbf432c2.png\" alt=\"\"></p><h3>新增商贩生物</h3><p>包含大量新交易内容</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/36836bf3c95c028d9ccb51b86eeb2a899820f498_0.webp\" alt=\"\"></p><h2>依赖项</h2><ul>\n<li>需安装同版本的暮色森林模组</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-twilight-forest</a></li>\n</ul>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
